=== The Compact UI Series

The Compact series (by *Stentorious*) shrinks individual menu screens so more information fits at once. Install any subset; they are independent.

=== #link("https://www.nexusmods.com/starfield/mods/682")[*Compact Mission Menu*]

Condenses the mission log so roughly half again as many quest steps are visible at once, and dims completed missions.

- *Author:* Stentorious
- *Version:* 3.0.0 (updated 2026-04-07)
- *Dependencies:* None
- *Impact:* UI only

=== #link("https://www.nexusmods.com/starfield/mods/1170")[*Compact Ship Builder UI*]

Fits about a third more ship parts on screen in the builder without sacrificing readability.

- *Author:* Stentorious
- *Version:* 2.0.0 (updated 2026-04-10)
- *Dependencies:* None
- *Impact:* UI only

=== #link("https://www.nexusmods.com/starfield/mods/3274")[*Compact Crafting UI*]

Tightens the crafting and cooking screens so more recipes and components are visible per scroll.

- *Author:* Stentorious
- *Version:* 2.0.0 (updated 2026-04-10)
- *Dependencies:* None
- *Impact:* UI only

=== #link("https://www.nexusmods.com/starfield/mods/3014")[*Compact Crew Menu*]

Compacts the crew assignment screen for faster companion and ship-crew management.

- *Author:* Stentorious
- *Version:* 2.0.0 (updated 2026-04-09)
- *Dependencies:* None
- *Impact:* UI only

=== #link("https://www.nexusmods.com/starfield/mods/3063")[*Compact Build Menu*]

Compacts the outpost build menu listing, pairing well with StarUI Outpost if you prefer its layout.

- *Author:* Stentorious
- *Version:* 2.0.0 (updated 2026-04-11)
