=== #link("https://www.nexusmods.com/starfield/mods/404")[*Undelayed Menus*]

Removes the fade-in/fade-out delays on every menu, raises menu refresh from 30 to 60 FPS, and speeds up hold-to-exit prompts.

- *Author:* Seb263
- *Version:* 1.0.6 (updated 2025-09-23)
- *Dependencies:* None
- *Impact:* UI speed only

=== #link("https://www.nexusmods.com/starfield/mods/214")[*BetterHUD - Immersive and Dynamic - User Configurable*]

Declutters the HUD: moves location/XP text, and lets you hide the XP bar, enemy health bars, and hit markers for a cleaner view.

- *Author:* KhaoMaat
- *Version:* 0.3 (updated 2023-09-21)
- *Dependencies:* None
- *Impact:* UI only — old but display-only, so staleness is weak evidence of breakage
